{
 "nodes": [
  {
   "id": "center",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -310,
   "y": -260,
   "width": 620,
   "height": 520,
   "text": "# New'O'Nautics\n## Mod Map - Connect\n\n**Red arrow** = a new connection we could build.\n\nOnly mods that have at least one arrow in this map are shown. `Mod Map.canvas` has every mod.\n\nColoured branches = category -> mod.\n\nEdges are suggestions; edit freely.\n\nSee [[Pack Scan - Compat Features]], [[Electricity Audit]]."
  },
  {
   "id": "hub_food",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1025,
   "y": 3072,
   "width": 340,
   "height": 120,
   "text": "# Food & Drink",
   "color": "2"
  },
  {
   "id": "fd",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2132,
   "y": 3566,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 148,
   "text": "**Farmer's Delight**\nCooking pot, skillet, cutting board, stove, crops, baskets. The base most food mods build on."
  },
  {
   "id": "kc",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1474,
   "y": 1680,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 174,
   "text": "**Kaleidoscope Cookery**\nChinese-style cooking: wok, stockpot, steamer, millstone, stove. Has its own dish Quality (Superb→Poor) and Recipe records."
  },
  {
   "id": "kc_tavern",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1911,
   "y": 2754,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 148,
   "text": "**KC Tavern**\nWine barrels with 6 brew levels, pressing tub, cocktail shaker, bar furniture."
  },
  {
   "id": "bnc",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1391,
   "y": 2728,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 122,
   "text": "**Brewin' & Chewin'**\nFermenting Keg for drinks, cheese wheels, fondue, quiche."
  },
  {
   "id": "dd",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 428,
   "y": 3106,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 122,
   "text": "**Display Delight**\nTurns ~400 FD/KC/other dishes into placeable plated food blocks."
  },
  {
   "id": "cck",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1677,
   "y": 3137,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 148,
   "text": "**Create: Central Kitchen**\nCreate automation for FD/KC: arms, deployers, funnels, packagers feed cooking blocks."
  },
  {
   "id": "hub_econ",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -144,
   "y": 2044,
   "width": 340,
   "height": 120,
   "text": "# Economy & Trade",
   "color": "3"
  },
  {
   "id": "numis",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 74,
   "y": 1599,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 148,
   "text": "**Create Numismatics**\nCoin currency, bank accounts and terminals, depositors, vendors (player shops)."
  },
  {
   "id": "deliver",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 318,
   "y": 2535,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 174,
   "text": "**Delivery Required**\nContractor delivery contracts, Market, P2P terminal; currency rewards; has a 'Crew Food Crate' contract."
  },
  {
   "id": "floor",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 444,
   "y": 2121,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 122,
   "text": "**Trading Floor**\nAutomate villager trading with a Trading Depot."
  },
  {
   "id": "tradeworks",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -690,
   "y": 2057,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 122,
   "text": "**Tradeworks**\nShelves and table cloths for displaying goods."
  },
  {
   "id": "hub_player",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -1064,
   "y": 699,
   "width": 340,
   "height": 120,
   "text": "# Player, World & Mobs",
   "color": "2"
  },
  {
   "id": "hub_qol",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -421,
   "y": 516,
   "width": 340,
   "height": 120,
   "text": "# Client, Performance & Libraries (not individually mapped)",
   "color": "5"
  },
  {
   "id": "ui",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -459,
   "y": 962,
   "width": 420,
   "height": 226,
   "text": "**UI, info & maps**\nJEI, Distraction Free Recipes, Jade, AppleSkin, Xaero minimap/world map, Controlling, Mouse Tweaks, Searchables, Crash Assistant, Chat Heads, Emojiful, Freecam, Ok Zoomer, WorldEdit, Essential (+Patcher, Tweaks), Sable Jade, Create Addon Organizer, NetherPortalFix."
  },
  {
   "id": "hub_decor",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -408,
   "y": -604,
   "width": 340,
   "height": 120,
   "text": "# Building, Decor & Dyes",
   "color": "5"
  },
  {
   "id": "dyedepot",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 240,
   "y": -847,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 122,
   "text": "**Dye Depot + Dye The World**\n16 new dyes and a huge range of dyed blocks, items and banners."
  },
  {
   "id": "dyebridge",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -351,
   "y": -954,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 122,
   "text": "**Dye bridges**\nDye Depot Aeroworks, CEE Dye Depot: coloured modules and motors."
  },
  {
   "id": "hub_create",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1113,
   "y": -1530,
   "width": 340,
   "height": 120,
   "text": "# Create Core & Logistics",
   "color": "5"
  },
  {
   "id": "create",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1792,
   "y": -1693,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 174,
   "text": "**Create 6.0**\nKinetic machines, fluids, trains, packages, vaults, and the mixing/pressing/crushing recipe types. The hub of the pack."
  },
  {
   "id": "mobpkg",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1069,
   "y": -518,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 122,
   "text": "**Mobile Packages**\nRobo Bee delivery drones, portable stock ticker and packager."
  },
  {
   "id": "dragons",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 531,
   "y": -1534,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 122,
   "text": "**Dragons Plus**\nLibrary/addon: dye buckets, freezing and 'ending' recipes."
  },
  {
   "id": "hub_aero",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1768,
   "y": -1277,
   "width": 340,
   "height": 120,
   "text": "# Aeronautics, Sable & Vehicles",
   "color": "3"
  },
  {
   "id": "sable",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2167,
   "y": 840,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 148,
   "text": "**Sable**\nPhysics-driven moving block structures (sub-levels). Core of the ship/vehicle side."
  },
  {
   "id": "propulsion",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 3665,
   "y": -1767,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 122,
   "text": "**Create Propulsion**\nThrusters, ion engines, fuel tanks, FE cables, wings."
  },
  {
   "id": "kinlift",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2720,
   "y": -1256,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 122,
   "text": "**Kinetic Lift**\nTurbofan jets that burn kerosene, control seat."
  },
  {
   "id": "hoseconn",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2540,
   "y": -1756,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 148,
   "text": "**Sable Hose Connectors**\nHose, item, wire and chain connectors between ships and the world."
  },
  {
   "id": "seats",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1624,
   "y": -213,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 122,
   "text": "**Furniture Seats**\nSit on furniture on Create / Sable contraptions."
  },
  {
   "id": "hub_industry",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2831,
   "y": -41,
   "width": 340,
   "height": 120,
   "text": "# Industry, Energy & Fluids",
   "color": "6"
  },
  {
   "id": "tfmg",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2599,
   "y": -903,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 148,
   "text": "**The Factory Must Grow (TFMG)**\nSteel, oil refining, chemical vat, engines, own electricity. Two jars installed."
  },
  {
   "id": "cdg",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 5771,
   "y": 233,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 148,
   "text": "**Diesel Generators**\nCrude oil, distillation, plant oil, biodiesel, diesel engines, concrete."
  },
  {
   "id": "petrochem",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 3486,
   "y": -833,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 148,
   "text": "**Petrochem**\nFull refinery chain: desalting, cracking, electrolyzer, turbine, kerosene, asphalt."
  },
  {
   "id": "petrodep",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2942,
   "y": -532,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 122,
   "text": "**Petro Deposits**\nPetroleum deposits, scanner and gauge for Petrochem."
  },
  {
   "id": "liquidfuel",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2244,
   "y": -271,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 122,
   "text": "**Create Liquid Fuel**\nPipe liquid fuel into Blaze Burners."
  },
  {
   "id": "ca",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 4013,
   "y": -719,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 122,
   "text": "**Crafts & Additions**\nKinetic ↔ FE: alternator, motor, wires, accumulator, tesla coil."
  },
  {
   "id": "pg",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2384,
   "y": 305,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 148,
   "text": "**Power Grid**\nSimulated electricity: transformers, FE inverter, solar tiles, punch cards."
  },
  {
   "id": "ee",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2950,
   "y": 353,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 148,
   "text": "**Electro Energetics**\nRealistic electricity: panels, breakers, resistors, converter to FE."
  },
  {
   "id": "hub_compute",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 516,
   "y": 527,
   "width": 340,
   "height": 120,
   "text": "# Computing, Logic & Scripting",
   "color": "2"
  },
  {
   "id": "cc",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 604,
   "y": 1039,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 122,
   "text": "**CC: Tweaked** (2 jars)\nProgrammable computers, turtles, monitors, modems."
  },
  {
   "id": "kubejs",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1137,
   "y": 1103,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 174,
   "text": "**KubeJS ecosystem**\nKubeJS, KubeJS Create, Additions, Rarity, ProbeJS, PonderJS, LootJS, TFMGJS, KubeJSDelight, KubeJSable, KJSC Auto."
  },
  {
   "id": "hub_guns",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "# Guns & Combat",
   "color": "3",
   "x": -994,
   "y": -828,
   "width": 340,
   "height": 120
  },
  {
   "id": "bpixel",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**Backpack Pixel**\nCreate-style backpack with function packs, tanks, arms. Worn packs live in player data (3 slots), not the inventory.",
   "x": -1379,
   "y": 290,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 174
  },
  {
   "id": "irons",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**Iron's Arms 'n Artifice**\nHistorical-fantasy firearms: flintlock, blunderbuss, modular parts and modifiers. Needs Iron's Lib; MT Artifice Hand Fix patches first-person hands.",
   "x": -254,
   "y": -2430,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 200
  },
  {
   "id": "yagm",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**Yet Another Gravestone Mod**\nGravestones that hold your items on death. Has an API for Curios / Accessories style compat.",
   "x": -1645,
   "y": 700,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 148
  }
